WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
There is not much water and compressed biscuits left

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Cancel breakfast starting today

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Quantity at noon and evening

4
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
divided into three groups

5
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,000
I'll take someone to check

6
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Blood medicine to find food

7
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Blood oil leads people to pick coconuts

8
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Whoever finds something takes it back first

9
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Don't keep it secret

10
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Did you hear that?

11
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Don't get lost again

12
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:26,140
Take care of yourself first Huifei

13
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:27,140
Pursuing hard is a waste of energy

14
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:36,340
Leave when you have enough to eat

15
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:41,250
I haven't been so tired even after falling for a whole day.

16
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:45,130
This doesn't smell good

17
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:46,130
You have the most ancestors

18
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:48,130
I just brought back a few coconuts

19
00:00:48,130 --> 00:00:49,130
Others go out to find food

20
00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:50,130
You guys went for a walk
